---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
✔ created [ROOT]/snapshotted (all platforms; default: web)
  next: cd [ROOT]/snapshotted && leptoskit build
  then: leptoskit db migration create init
before starting the server, set AUTH_ENCRYPTION_KEYS: export AUTH_ENCRYPTION_KEYS="$(date +%Y-%m):$(openssl rand 32 | basenc --base64url | tr -d =)"
